  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c0510027ce449749a5f649919b62b4a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialUI: {fileID: 0}
  tutText:
  - A while ago, all 3 Godfish have escaped into the universe, leaving earth to rot
    away without their divine energy to uphold the balance of nature.
  - It is your job to find them, catch them, and bring them back with you.
  - First, use WASD to move around.
  - Now fish in the Pond next to you and catch your first fish.
  - Great! Walk over to the Fish Harvester on the right and turn your fish into beautiful
    Fish Bits.
  - There are no Godfish in this area, so use your Fish Bits you just got to travel
    to the next galaxy.
  - You can find the Terminal on the left.
  - This is the end of the tutorial, have fun!
  tutorialCanvas: {fileID: 0}
  tutorialIndex: 0
  tutorialActive: 1
